(MACRO Go to G30)
(FRAME machine)
(Moves to the stored tool-change position: Z up first - only ever up - then X and Y, then Z. The suite's own routine.)
(Example macro of the lcnc-suite: edit it in the Macros tab or replace it.)
o<go_to_g30_macro> sub
  M73
  G90
  o<go_to_g30> call
o<go_to_g30_macro> endsub
